        },
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "What week three actually measures"
          }
        ],
        "role": "heading",
        "fontSize": 28,
        "fontWeight": 500,
        "align": "left",
        "pinnedStyle": {
          "font-family": "'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif",
          "color": "#f1ece0"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "pf-post1-p2",
        "type": "text",
        "box": {
          "x": 240,
          "y": 480,
          "w": 720,
          "h": 156,
          "z": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The fact that the user returned to do real work — not curiosity, not novelty, not the same five clicks they did the first time. It measures whether the edges of the product hold up: the empty state, the error case, the upgrade path, the boring repeat task on a Tuesday afternoon. None of that shows up in a launch demo. All of it shows up at week three."
          }
        ],
        "role": "body",
        "fontSize": 17,
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "align": "left",
        "pinnedStyle": {
          "color": "#d8d2c6"
        },
