        "box": {
          "x": 240,
          "y": 668,
          "w": 720,
          "h": 48,
          "z": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "How to build for it"
          }
        ],
        "role": "heading",
        "fontSize": 28,
        "fontWeight": 500,
        "align": "left",
        "pinnedStyle": {
          "font-family": "'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif",
          "color": "#f1ece0"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "pf-post1-p3",
        "type": "text",
        "box": {
          "x": 240,
          "y": 740,
          "w": 720,
          "h": 180,
          "z": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Ship the boring parts first. The thing that loads when the database is empty. The error that fires when the third-party API is down. The path the user takes after they finish the canonical flow and need to do it again. If your demo skips these, you've built a trailer, not a product."
          }
        ],
        "role": "body",
